          "settings": {
            "quiz_title": "Step into the scene.",
            "quiz_description": "It’s late. Your phone lights up with a message from someone you can’t stop thinking about.<br>\nFive moments. Five choices.<br>\nDon’t choose what sounds right. <br>Choose what you want to happen next.",
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "question_1": "11:47 p.m.Your phone vibrates beside you.A new message appears:“I know what you need tonight. Come upstairs. No questions.”You read it twice. What makes you want to walk through that door?",
            "q1_option_1": "The feeling that they’ve already planned every detail.",
            "q1_option_2": "The chance to walk in and turn their plan into yours.",
            "q1_option_3": "The challenge—I want to see which one of us gives in first.",
            "q1_option_4": "The mystery. I want to know what kind of night this becomes.",
            "q1_option_5": "Others",
            "question_2": "The door closes behind you.The lights are low. Music is playing somewhere in the room, but you can’t see where they are yet.Then their voice comes from behind you:“Close your eyes.”What do you want to happen next?",
            "q2_option_1": "They take your hand first, making sure you feel safe before leading you further.",
            "q2_option_2": "They stay exactly where they are until you tell them to come closer.",
            "q2_option_3": "They move close enough for you to feel them—then step away again.",
            "q2_option_4": "They keep speaking from the shadows until the room in your imagination feels more real than the one around you.",
            "q2_option_5": "Others",
            "question_3": "Their voice is closer now.“Tell me when you want me to stop.”For a moment, nothing happens. The waiting becomes almost unbearable.Which next move would pull you completely into the scene?",
            "q3_option_1": "They whisper, “You don’t have to think. I’ve got you,” and take the lead.",
            "q3_option_2": "They follow your instructions exactly, adjusting to every reaction.",
            "q3_option_3": "They do almost what you asked—but change just enough to challenge you.",
            "q3_option_4": "They begin telling you who they are, why they brought you here and what they have imagined doing all night.",
            "q3_option_5": "Others",
            "question_4": "The tension has been building slowly.Then everything pauses.They look at you and ask:“Do you want control?”What do you do?",
            "q4_option_1": "Shake your head. You want them to keep leading, now that you finally trust where they are taking you.",
            "q4_option_2": "Take it—and show them exactly how you want the rest of the night to go.",
            "q4_option_3": "Take control for a moment, then give it back when they least expect it.",
            "q4_option_4": "Tell them to continue the story. You want to find out what this version of you does next.",
            "q4_option_5": "Others",
            "question_5": "Much later, the room is quiet again.The music has stopped. Your breathing is slower, but your mind keeps replaying one part of the night.Which moment stays with you?",
            "q5_option_1": "The moment you stopped thinking and felt completely cared for.",
            "q5_option_2": "The way they responded to every move you made.",
            "q5_option_3": "The second the power changed hands and surprised you both.",
            "q5_option_4": "The voice, the atmosphere and the feeling that, for a while, you had stepped into another life.",
            "q5_option_5": "Others",
